AAGUID provider-name mapping adapted from:
https://github.com/passwordless-id/webauthn/blob/41842c401f8dd8cb40b53be6eef4bb9ee30913ee/src/authenticatorMetadata.ts
Only selected identifier/name pairs are included; no icons or executable code.
Names are used only as editable display labels, never for trust decisions.

